WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
A soft chime opens the audio guide.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.200
The clay pot was hand-shaped and kiln-fired. Its surface carries no glaze.

3
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:13.400
Beside it, a coiled basket rim shows the same plant fibre woven round and round.

4
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:18.600
The jade stone turns slowly, catching the light as it goes.

5
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:21.800
A closing chime ends the guide. Walk around the exhibit to hear each object's own sound.
